# Example private linkset: the same (fictional) person under two publishers' IRIs.
# Kept apart from both datasets; load it only when cross-organisation identity
# is wanted (and permitted — membership data is personal data).

@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix sor:  <https://example.org/soror-exemplum/> .
@prefix club: <https://example.org/lanternmere/> .

sor:ada owl:sameAs club:hb-member-12 .
